Next, in the beginning of each python file (For example, for Use Case 4 & 5 it would be [UC45-ETL.py](https://github.com/EGA-archive/EuCanImage-FHIR/blob/main/UC4%265_Rectal_Cancer/UC45-ETL.py), you will need to change the variable `relative_path_csv` to change the name of the file matching the one of the input.\r
