\r
## Introduction\r
\r
This analysis workflow is centered on [foldseek](https://github.com/steineggerlab/foldseek), which enables fast structural similarity searches and supports the discovery of understudied genes by comparing plants, which are distantly related species, with humans, for which there is a wealth of information.\r
Based on the list of genes you are interested in, you can easily create a scatter plot of **“structural similarity vs. sequence similarity”** by retrieving structural data from the [AlphaFold protein structure database (AFDB)](https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/).\r
\r
&nbsp;\r
\r
&nbsp;\r
\r
