\r
- Docker / Orbstack\r
- [cwltool](https://github.com/common-workflow-language/cwltool) >= 3.1.20250110105449\r
\r
> **?? Note:** This workflow is based on Common Workflow Language (CWL). Please see the [Official Document](https://www.commonwl.org/user_guide/)\r
\r
