## ?? Analysis Example ( *Oryza sativa subsp.japonica* 100 genes vs *Homo sapiens*) ?? (ver. 2026-03-20)\r
\r
Here, we will explain how to use the list of 100 rice genes as an example.\r
\r
&nbsp;\r
\r
## 0. Clone Repository\r
\r
