    ns1:description """This workflow is used to process timeseries from meteorological stations in Finland but can be applied to any timeseries according it follows the same format.\r
\r
Take a temperature timeseries from any meteorological station. Input format is csv and it must be standardized with 6 columns:\r
\r
1. Year	(ex: 2021)\r
2. month	(ex: 1)\r
3. day	(ex: 15) \r
4. Time	(ex: 16:56)\r
5. Time zone	(such as UTC)\r
6. Air temperature (degC)""" ;
