    ns1:description """The workflow starts with selecting KLF6 as the search term. RNA-seq-like LINCS L1000 Signatures[1] which mimick or reverse the the expression of KLF6 were visualized. Median expression of KLF6 was obtained from the GTEx Portal[6] using the portal's API. To visualize the scored tissues, a vertical bar plot was created Fig.. \r
1. Evangelista, J. E. et al. SigCom LINCS: data and metadata search engine for a million gene expression signatures. Nucleic Acids Research vol. 50 W697–W709 (2022). doi:10.1093/nar/gkac328\r
6. Lonsdale, J. et al. The Genotype-Tissue Expression (GTEx) project. Nature Genetics vol. 45 580–585 (2013). doi:10.1038/ng.2653""" ;
