    ns1:description """# Prostate cancer classification workflow\r
\r
This workflow segments tissue regions and classifies prostate cancer on H&E whole slide images, using AI. It consists of three steps:\r
\r
1. low-resolution tissue segmentation to select areas for further processing;\r
\r
2. high-resolution tissue segmentation to refine borders - it uses step 1 as input;\r
\r
3. high-resolution normal/cancer classification - it uses step 1 as input.\r
""" ;
