&nbsp;\r
\r
# CWL4IncorporateTSSintoGXF\r
\r
This workflow determines TSS based on the analysis of CAGE-seq data and incorporates TSS information and 5'UTR information calculated based on TSS information into the gene annotation file (gff/gtf). The R package, [TSSr](https://github.com/Linlab-slu/TSSr), is used to determine TSS.  \r
\r
## Requirements\r
\r
- [cwltool](https://github.com/common-workflow-language/cwltool)  \r
\r
    Install using pip  \r
    ```\r
    pip  install cwltool  \r
    ```\r
\r
    Install using conda  \r
    ```\r
    conda create -n cwltool  \r
    conda activate cwltool  \r
    conda install -c conda-forge cwltool \r
    ``` \r
\r
- [docker](https://www.docker.com/)  \r
\r
    † and Docker Desktop must be running  \r
\r
## Simple usage  \r
\r
- Clone this repository  \r
\r
    ```\r
    git clone https://github.com/RyoNozu/CWL4IncorporateTSSintoGXF.git\r
    cd CWL4IncorporateTSSintoGXF\r
    ```\r
\r
- Run workflow  \r
\r
    ```\r
    # for paired-end reads case\r
    cwltool --debug --cachedir ./cwl_cache/ --outdir ./test/ ./workflow/cageseq_gtf_update_pe.cwl ./config/Workflow_config/cageseq_gtf_update_pe.yml\r
    ```\r
    - Prep your case yml file referring to the [template](https://github.com/RyoNozu/CWL4IncorporateTSSintoGXF/blob/main/config/workflow_template.yml)  \r
        • Refer to the [Link](https://view.commonwl.org/workflows/github.com/RyoNozu/CWL4IncorporateTSSintoGXF/blob/main/workflow/cageseq_gtf_update_pe.cwl) for details on each parameter that needs to be specified  \r
    - A single-ended version (cageseq_gtf_update_se.cwl) is in prep as of 20240417  \r
\r
## Input files  \r
\r
- CAGE-seq Read (fastq, paried/single-end)  \r
- reference genome (fasta)  \r
- gene annotation file (gff/gtf)  \r
- (BSgenome_data_package_seed_file (.txt))  \r
        > refere to forgeBSgenomeDataPkg function in [BSgenomeForge](https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/html/BSgenomeForge.html) package  \r
\r
## Output files  \r
\r
- updated gxf file (.gff/gtf)  \r
\r
## FYI: Running time\r
\r
***\r
""" ;
