    ns1:description """# BVSim: A Benchmarking Variation Simulator Mimicking Human Variation Spectrum\r
\r
[![Profile views](https://komarev.com/ghpvc/?username=YongyiLuo98&repo=BVSim&label=Profile%20views&color=0e75b6&style=flat)](https://github.com/YongyiLuo98/BVSim)\r
