    ns1:dateModified "2026-06-16" ;
    ns1:description """This workflow performs a basic Virtual Drug Screening Pipeline.\r
THe workflows uses the following protocols:\r
		1.a) Import receptor: Imports the atomic structure with PDB code 4ERF.\r
		1.b) Import small molecules: Imports a set of 4 molecules from local files.\r
		2.a) Receptor preparation: selects A chain and cleans the structure from waters and heteroatoms\r
		2.b) RDKit Molecules preparation: adds hydrogens and prepares the molecules for docking\r
		3.a) Find pockets: uses P2Rank to predict the most promising pockets\r
		3.b) Molecule filtering: filters out molecules that contain Br\r
		4) Docking with Vina: performs the docking of the filtered molecules onto the predicted pocket using Vina\r
		5) Filters docking set: filters out 50% of the molecules with the worst score \r
""" ;
    ns1:hasPart "autodock",
        "autodock_vina",
        "p2rank",
        "scipion",
        "scipion_chem" ;
    ns1:identifier "1364" ;
    ns1:keywords "autodock",
        "bioinformatics",
        "cheminformatics",
        "drug design",
