**Tutorial Contributor(s)**: [Björn Grüning](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/bgruening/), [Leonid Kostrykin](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/kostrykin/), [Diana Chiang Jurado](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/dianichj/), [Helena Rasche](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/hexylena/)

[![gtn star logo followed by the word workflows](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/assets/branding/gtn-workflows.png)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/)""" ;
