    ns1:description """The idea of this workflow is to compare annotation with two annotation tools that differ in their approach and operation.\r
\r
## Associated Tutorial\r
\r
This workflows is part of the tutorial [Comparison of two annotation tools - Helixer and Braker3](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/topics/genome-annotation/tutorials/comparison-braker-helixer-annotation/tutorial.html), available in the [GTN](https://training.galaxyproject.org)\r
\r
## Features\r
\r
* Includes [Galaxy Workflow Tests](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/faqs/gtn/workflow_run_test.html)\r
* Includes a [Galaxy Workflow Report](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/faqs/galaxy/workflows_report_view.html)\r
* Uses [Galaxy Workflow Comments](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/faqs/galaxy/workflows_comments.html)\r
\r
## Thanks to...\r
