    ns1:description """# Generate annotated gb for fragments and add them to DB\r
\r
Automatically generate annotated **GenBank** files for your fragments based on your constraints and store them in your database.\r
\r
## steps:\r
\r
_input_: **GenBank** files : If your fragments are not in the database, you can generate GenBank files for each fragment to be used as input for the annotation workflow and then passed to the _evaluate_manufacturability_ tool.\r
> evaluate_manufacturability\r
1. Set the constraints for the annotations.\r
2. Generate annotated GenBank files and pass them to the _seq_to_db_ tool.\r
> seq_to_db\r
1. Annotated GenBank files can be saved to the database, depending on the user's choice.""" ;
