    ns1:dateCreated "2025-07-13" ;
    ns1:dateModified "2025-07-13" ;
    ns1:description """Code and supporting data for the article: "Exploring the role of normalization and feature selection in microbiome disease classification pipelines."\r
\r
The repository contains the following folders:\r
\r
* **1. data:** contains OTU/ASV tables and class annotations for the 15 curated datasets considered.\r
* **2. src:** code writen to perform the analyses from the article and the statistical tests\r
* **3. results:** tables containing global nested cross validation results\r
* **4. figures**\r
\r
\r
## License: This project is licensed under GNU GPL 3.0 - check LICENSE file for more details.\r
\r
\r
| Dataset | Samples (Cases, Controls) | Features | IR  | Project ID |\r
|---------|---------------------------|----------|-----|------------|\r
| ART     | 114 (86, 28)               | 10733    | 3.07 | PRJNA203810    |\r
| CDI     | 336 (93, 243)              | 3456     | 2.61 | 10.1128/mbio.01021-14 (DOI)              |\r
| CRC1    | 490 (229, 261)             | 6920     | 1.14 | PRJNA290926    |\r
| CRC2    | 102 (46, 56)               | 837      | 1.22 | SRP005150      |\r
| HIV     | 350 (293, 57)              | 14425    | 5.14 | PRJNA307231    |\r
| CD1     | 140 (78, 62)               | 3547     | 1.26 | PRJNA237362    |\r
| CD2     | 160 (68, 92)               | 3547     | 1.35 | PRJNA237362    |\r
| IBD1    | 91 (67, 24)                | 2742     | 2.79 | PRJNA82109     |\r
| IBD2    | 114 (68, 46)               | 1496     | 1.48 | 10.1053/j.gastro.2010.08.049 (DOI)              |\r
| CIR     | 77 (51, 26)                | 3104     | 1.96 | PRJNA174838    |\r
| MHE     | 77 (26, 51)                | 3104     | 1.96 | PRJNA174838    |\r
| OB      | 281 (220, 61)              | 6386     | 3.61 | PRJNA32089     |\r
| PAR1    | 148 (74, 74)               | 10232    | 1.00 | PRJEB4927      |\r
| PAR2    | 333 (201, 132)             | 6844     | 1.52 | PRJNA601994    |\r
| PAR3    | 507 (323, 184)             | 12198    | 1.76 | PRJNA601994    |\r
\r
*Notes:*  \r
- ART: Arthritis; CDI: Clostridium difficile Infection; CRC1 and CRC2: Colorectal Cancer; HIV: Human Immunodeficiency Virus; CD1 and CD2: Crohn's Disease; IBD1 and IBD2: Inflammatory Bowel Disease; CIR: Cirrhosis; MHE: Minimal Hepatic Encephalopathy; OB: Obesity; PAR1, PAR2, and PAR3: Parkinson's Disease.  \r
- CD1 and CD2 were taken from MLRepo, PAR2 and PAR3 were retrieved from their respective article sources, and the remaining datasets were obtained from MicrobiomeHD.\r
- Project IDs from NCBI for raw data. IBD2 data is only available via MicrobiomeHD repository, CDI raw data is available at mothur (https://mothur.org/CDI_MicrobiomeModeling/)\r
""" ;
