**Tutorial Author(s)**: [Yi Sun](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/sunyi000/), [Arif UI Maula Khan](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/maulakhan/)

[![gtn star logo followed by the word workflows](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/assets/branding/gtn-workflows.png)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/)""" ;
