    ns1:description """**Workflow for long read quality control, contamination filtering, assembly, variant calling and annotation.**\r
- Preprocessing of reference file\r
- LongReadSum before and after filtering (read quality control)\r
- Filtlong filter on quality and length \r
- Flye assembly\r
- Minimap2 mapping of reads and assembly\r
- Clair3 variant calling of reads\r
- Freebayes variant calling of assembly\r
- Optional Bakta annotation of genomes with no reference\r
- SnpEff building or downloading of a database\r
- SnpEff functional annotation\r
- Liftoff annotation lift over\r
\r
This workflow on WorkflowHub: https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/1868\r
\r
**All tool CWL files and other workflows can be found here:**\r
  Tools: https://git.wur.nl/ssb/automated-data-analysis/cwl/-/tree/main/tools\r
  Workflows: https://git.wur.nl/ssb/automated-data-analysis/cwl/-/tree/main/workflows\r
""" ;
