* Includes a [Galaxy Workflow Report](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/faqs/galaxy/workflows_report_view.html)

## Thanks to...

**Workflow Author(s)**: Daniela Schneider

**Tutorial Author(s)**: [Daniela Schneider](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/Sch-Da/), [Rand Zoabi](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/RZ9082/)

**Tutorial Contributor(s)**: [Björn Grüning](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/bgruening/), [Rand Zoabi](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/RZ9082/), [Daniela Schneider](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/Sch-Da/), [Saskia Hiltemann](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/shiltemann/)

**Funder(s)**: [German Competence Center Cloud Technologies for Data Management and Processing](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/deKCD/), [Ministry of Science, Research and Arts](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/mwk/), [German Network for Bioinformatics Infrastructure Service, Training, Cooperations & Cloud Computing](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/deNBI/)

[![gtn star logo followed by the word workflows](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/assets/branding/gtn-workflows.png)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/)""" ;
