    ns1:dateCreated "2026-01-07" ;
    ns1:dateModified "2026-01-09" ;
    ns1:description """4D-BioReconX is a scalable and versatile framework designed to construct a comprehensive four-dimensional (4D) spatial transcriptomics atlas of whole animals at single-cell resolution. This approach enables us to track the intricate spatiotemporal dependencies of morphogenetic gradients and regenerative patterning. It runs based on spatial transcriptomics data, such as Stereo-seq (spatial enhanced resolution omics sequencing) data. Notably, we are still working on the improvement of performance and calculation efficiency.\r
\r
""" ;
    ns1:identifier "2045" ;
    ns1:license "Apache-2.0" ;
    ns1:name "4D-BioReconX: a bioinformatic framework for reconstructing 4D spatial transcriptomics atlas and spatiotemporal analyses+" ;
    ns1:url <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/2045?version=1> ;
    ns1:version "1" .

