<https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/2062?version=1> a ns1:ComputationalWorkflow ;
    dcterms:conformsTo "https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalWorkflow/1.0-RELEASE" ;
    ns1:citation "10.48546/workflowhub.workflow.2062.1" ;
    ns1:creator "Alejandro Garcia",
        "Eric Ferrer",
        "Genis Bonet",
        "Gilbert Montane",
        "Miguel Castrillo",
        "Pablo Goitia" ;
    ns1:dateCreated "2026-01-23" ;
    ns1:dateModified "2026-05-13" ;
    ns1:description """EC-Earth3 workflow without wrappers running in MeluXina with Autosubmit v3.15.14, used to assess the effects of task aggregation on queueing times. Workflow configuration is based on the Auto-EC-Earth3's testing suite [1].\r
    \r
In order to reduce the size of the workflow, files in the _/tmp_ directory have been deleted. Additionally, the experiment has been cleaned up with the Autosubmit [`clean`](https://autosubmit.readthedocs.io/en/master/userguide/manage/index.html#how-to-clean-the-experiment) command. The experiment requires to refetch the project sources. Platform-related identifiers have been anonymized in the configuration files and marked with angle brackets.\r
\r
[1] Garcia Lopez, A., Arriola Meikle, L., Montane Pinto, G., Castrillo, M., de Paula Kinoshita, B., Ferrer Escuin, E., and Gaya Avila, A.: Enabling reliable workflow development with an advanced Testing Suite, EGU General Assembly 2025, Vienna, Austria, 27 Apr-2 May 2025, EGU25-8305, https://doi.org/10.5194/egusphere-egu25-8305, 2025.""" ;
    ns1:identifier "2062" ;
    ns1:keywords "autosubmit",
        "ec-earth",
        "task aggregation",
        "wrappers" ;
    ns1:license "Apache-2.0" ;
    ns1:name "EC-Earth3 workflow without wrappers in MeluXina" ;
    ns1:url <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/2062?version=1> ;
    ns1:version "1" .

