<https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/2064?version=1> a ns1:ComputationalWorkflow ;
    dcterms:conformsTo "https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalWorkflow/1.0-RELEASE" ;
    ns1:citation "10.48546/workflowhub.workflow.2064.1" ;
    ns1:creator "Alejandro Garcia",
        "Eric Ferrer",
        "Genis Bonet",
        "Gilbert Montane",
        "Miguel Castrillo",
        "Pablo Goitia" ;
    ns1:dateCreated "2026-01-23" ;
    ns1:dateModified "2026-05-13" ;
    ns1:description """EC-Earth3 workflow without wrappers running in MareNostrum 5 with Autosubmit v3.15.18, used to assess the effects of task aggregation on queueing times. Workflow configuration is based on the Auto-EC-Earth3's testing suite [1].\r
    \r
In order to reduce the size of the workflow, files in the _/tmp_ directory have been deleted. Additionally, the experiment has been cleaned up with the Autosubmit [`clean`](https://autosubmit.readthedocs.io/en/master/userguide/manage/index.html#how-to-clean-the-experiment) command. The experiment requires to refetch the project sources. Platform-related identifiers have been anonymized in the configuration files and marked with angle brackets.\r
\r
