\r
This pipeline is published on Workflowhub using the nf-core template. If you use this pipeline in you work, the following citations are essential:\r
\r
excon:\r
Wyatt, C. (2026). Gene EXpansion and CONtraction analysis pipeline. WorkflowHub. https://doi.org/10.48546/WORKFLOWHUB.WORKFLOW.2141.8\r
