        "Cali Willet",
        "Madison Gonebale",
        "Marina Kennerson",
        "Michael Geaghan",
        "Mitchell O'Brien" ;
    ns1:dateCreated "2026-04-14" ;
    ns1:dateModified "2026-05-13" ;
    ns1:description """# ORBiT\r
A Nextflow workflow for analysing Oxford Nanopore Technologies (ONT) RNAseq direct read sequening (DRS) or cDNA data. \r
\r
This workflow emphasises sensitivity to detect rare and novel features within the data. Multiple aspects of this workflow are tailored to enhance sensitivity: \r
\r
- Alignment to reference genome rather than transcriptome\r
- Multiple tools per analysis type (n = 2 isoforms, n = 3 fusions)\r
- Reads quantification tools capable of detecting novel isoforms, and counting at the isoform level\r
- Inclusion of an ultra-sensitive tool to report gene fusions involving any other genomic sequence, not just gene:gene\r
\r
## Workflow tools \r
\r
The workflow runs with Nextflow, and uses singularity containers for all tools. Tool versions used in this release and their container file source are listed below.\r
Latest version tools used:\r
\r
- nextflow v 25.10.3\r
- singulairty v 3.11.3\r
- [dorado v 1.3.1](https://quay.io/repository/sangerpathogens/cuda_dorado?tab=tags&tag=1.3.1)\r
- [fastplong v 0.4.1](https://quay.io/repository/biocontainers/fastplong:0.4.1--h224cc79_0)\r
- [minimap2 v 2.30](community.wave.seqera.io/library/minimap2_samtools:b09096fc890429c)\r
- [samtools v 1.23.1](https://quay.io/repository/biocontainers/samtools:1.23.1--ha83d96e_0)\r
- [Nanoplot v 1.46.2](https://quay.io/repository/biocontainers/nanoplot:1.46.2--pyhdfd78af_1)\r
- [IsoQuant v 3.12.2](https://quay.io/repository/biocontainers/isoquant:3.12.2--pyh106432d_0)\r
- [Isosceles v 0.2.1](https://zenodo.org/records/10951160/files/isosceles.sif)\r
- [seqkit v 2.13.0](community.wave.seqera.io/library/seqkit:2.13.0--05c0a96bf9fb2751)\r
- [JAFFALv 2.5](davidsongroup/jaffa:2.5)\r
- [CTAT-LR-Fusion v 1.40](https://hub.docker.com/layers/trinityctat/ctat_lr_fusion/1.4.0/images/sha256-1cca5fc03bcee40650ff5d22458bafa99bd9af335fcf0a0e9c70b39cfc0b5e53)\r
- [GIFFL v 1.0.1](https://github.com/Sydney-Informatics-Hub/GIFFL/releases/download/1.0.1/giffl_1.0.1.sif) \r
\r
## Help / FAQ / Troubleshooting\r
\r
Please submit an [issue](https://github.com/Sydney-Informatics-Hub/ORBiT/issues/new/choose) for any bug reports, feature requests, or questions.\r
\r
