    ns1:dateModified "2026-08-18" ;
    ns1:description """## TrialHarvest-AI workflow description\r
\r
TrialHarvest-AI is a multi-phase workflow that extracts structured data from scientific \r
literature on Long Term Experiments (LTEs). The main phases of the workflow are:\r
1. Convert scientific-literature PDFs into structured markdown.\r
2. Run schema-driven LLM extraction over the markdown.\r
3. Validate extracted JSON through type, semantic, and AGROVOC checks.\r
4. Assess extraction quality and generate figures.\r
\r
This is an abstract workflow description, that serves as a documentation of the overall workflow structure. It is a first step towards a fully executable workflow.\r
""" ;
