  - [HCV reference sequences](#hcv-reference-sequences)\r
  - [Co-infections (major and minor strains)](#co-infections-major-and-minor-strains)\r
  - [Candidate selection](#candidate-selection)\r
  - [De novo corroboration thresholds](#de-novo-corroboration-thresholds)\r
  - [De novo subtype rescue](#de-novo-subtype-rescue)\r
  - [Dominance-score weights](#dominance-score-weights)\r
