</h1>\r
\r
[![Open in GitHub Codespaces](https://img.shields.io/badge/Open_In_GitHub_Codespaces-black?labelColor=grey&logo=github)](https://github.com/codespaces/new/nf-core/fspassemblypipeline)\r
