    ns1:description """Historical executable generation of the NEXUS CORTEX lifecycle workflow for the welcome-to-github research software lineage, recorded from repository state 0b2e45c0b2eff554cf40431ce3c53693d86bc290 on 2026-10-07.\r
\r
