    ns1:description """Workflow for the Galaxy Training Network tutorial "Metabarcoding of bacteria in dunnart faecal samples across Australia (wild + captive) using QIIME 2"

## Associated Tutorial

This workflows is part of the tutorial [Metabarcoding of bacteria in dunnart faecal samples across Australia (wild + captive) using QIIME 2](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/topics/microbiome/tutorials/dunnart_metabarcoding/tutorial.html), available in the [GTN](https://training.galaxyproject.org)

