    ns1:description """**Workflow (hybrid) metagenomic assembly and binning**<br>\r
  - Workflow Illumina Quality: [https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/336](https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/336)\r
    - Sequali (control)\r
    - hostile contamination filter\r
    - fastp (quality trimming)\r
  - Workflow Longread Quality:	[https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/337](https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/337)\r
    - NanoPlot (control)\r
    - fastplong (quality trimming)\r
    - hostile contamination filter\r
  - Kraken2 taxonomic classification of FASTQ reads\r
  - SPAdes/Flye (Assembly)\r
  - Medaka/PyPolCA (Assembly polishing)\r
  - QUAST (Assembly quality report)\r
\r
  (optional)\r
  - Workflow binnning: [https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/64](https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/64)\r
    - Metabat2/MaxBin2/SemiBin\r
    - Binette\r
    - BUSCO\r
    - GTDB-Tk\r
\r
(optional)\r
  - MAG annotation: [https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/1170](https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/1170)\r
    - Bakta\r
    - Eggnog\r
    - InterProScan\r
    - Kofamscan\r
    - SAPP (to RDF) conversion\r
    \r
\r
  (optional)\r
  - Workflow Genome-scale metabolic models [https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/372](https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/372])\r
    - CarveMe (GEM generation)\r
    - MEMOTE (GEM test suite)\r
    - SMETANA (Species METabolic interaction ANAlysis)\r
\r
Other UNLOCK workflows on WorkflowHub: https://workflowhub.eu/projects/16/workflows?view=default<br><br>\r
\r
This workflow version was used in analysis: "A metadata managed FAIR end-to-end workflow for microbial community Omics data analysis"\r
""" ;
