|1      |80/f03e46|131999   |gatk_index    |COMPLETED|0   |55:46.7|22.6s     |22.3s     |231.90%|3.8 GB  |37.1 GB  |3.1 GB |726 KB |\r
|2      |ea/e29535|131594   |bwa_index     |COMPLETED|0   |55:44.9|1h 50m 16s|1h 50m 15s|99.50% |4.5 GB  |4.5 GB   |12.1 GB|8.2 GB |\r
\r
