<https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/399?version=22> a ns1:ComputationalWorkflow ;
    dcterms:conformsTo "https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalWorkflow/1.0-RELEASE" ;
    ns1:citation "" ;
    ns1:creator "Lucille Delisle" ;
    ns1:dateCreated "2026-07-14" ;
    ns1:dateModified "2026-07-14" ;
    ns1:description "This workflow take as input a collection of paired fastq. It will remove bad quality and adapters with cutadapt. Map with Bowtie2 end-to-end. Will remove reads on MT and unconcordant pairs and pairs with mapping quality below 30 and PCR duplicates. Will compute the pile-up on 5' +- 100bp. Will call peaks and count the number of reads falling in the 1kb region centered on the summit. Will plot the number of reads for each fragment length." ;
