\r
This workflow can be used with whole-genome and whole-exome sequencing data as input. For WES data, parts of the analysis can be restricted to the exome capture kits target regions by providing the optional "Regions of Interest" bed dataset.\r
\r
The current version uses bwa-mem for read mapping and varscan somatic for variant calling and somatic status classification.""" ;
