    ns1:description """**Name:** Word Count  \r
**Contact Person**: support-compss@bsc.es  \r
**Access Level**: public  \r
**License Agreement**: Apache2  \r
**Platform**: COMPSs  \r
\r
# Description\r
Wordcount is an application that counts the number of words for a given set of files.\r
\r
To allow parallelism every file is treated separately and merged afterwards.\r
\r
# Execution instructions\r
Usage:\r
```\r
runcompss --lang=python src/wordcount.py datasetPath\r
```\r
\r
where:\r
* datasetPath: Absolute path of the file to parse (e.g. /home/compss/tutorial_apps/python/wordcount/data/)\r
\r
# Execution Examples\r
```\r
runcompss --lang=python src/wordcount.py $(pwd)/data/\r
runcompss src/wordcount.py $(pwd)/data/\r
python -m pycompss src/wordcount.py $(pwd)/data/\r
```\r
\r
# Build\r
No build is required\r
""" ;
