    - Binette (bin merging)<br>\r
    - EukRep (eukaryotic classification)<br>\r
    - CheckM2 (bin completeness and contamination)<br>\r
    - BUSCO (bin completeness)<br>\r
    - GTDB-Tk (bin taxonomic classification)<br>\r
