    ns1:description """**Contact Person:** support-compss@bsc.es  \r
**Access Level:** public  \r
**License Agreement:** Apache2  \r
**Platform:** COMPSs  \r
\r
# Description\r
\r
Simple is an application that takes one value and increases it by five units. The purpose of this application is to show how tasks are managed by COMPSs.\r
\r
# Execution instructions\r
Usage:\r
```\r
runcompss --lang=python src/simple.py initValue\r
```\r
\r
where:\r
* initValue: Initial value for counter\r
\r
# Execution Examples\r
```\r
runcompss --lang=python src/simple.py 1\r
runcompss src/simple.py 1\r
python -m pycompss src/simple.py 1\r
```\r
\r
# Build\r
No build is required\r
""" ;
