    ns1:description """**Name:** Increment  \r
**Contact Person**: support-compss@bsc.es  \r
**Access Level**: public  \r
**License Agreement**: Apache2  \r
**Platform**: COMPSs  \r
\r
# Description\r
Increment is an application that takes three different values and increases them a number of given times.\r
\r
The purpose of this application is to show parallelism between the different increments.\r
\r
# Execution instructions\r
Usage:\r
```\r
runcompss --lang=python src/increment.py N initValue1 initValue2 initValue3\r
```\r
\r
where:\r
* N: Number of times to increase the counters\r
* initValue1: Initial value for counter 1\r
* initValue2: Initial value for counter 2\r
* initValue3: Initial value for counter 3\r
\r
# Execution Examples\r
```\r
runcompss --lang=python src/increment.py 10 1 2 3\r
runcompss src/wordcount.py src/increment.py 10 1 2 3\r
python -m pycompss src/wordcount.py src/increment.py 10 1 2 3\r
```\r
\r
# Build\r
No build is required\r
""" ;
