## Output\r
\r
All output files are saved to the `results` direcotry. Below is a table summarising all of the output files generated by the pipeline.\r
\r
| Directory             | Description               |\r
|-----------------------|---------------------------|\r
| fastqc_raw            | Fastqc reports for raw input reads |\r
| fastp                 | Fastp reports from quality control of raw reads |\r
| fastqc_qc             | Fastqc reports for quality controlled reads |\r
| go_fetch              | Optional output containing reference databases used by GetOrganelle |\r
