| annotations           | Annotation outputs of mitos |\r
| summary               | Summary per sample (seqkit stats), contig (GC content, length, coverage, taxonomy and annotations) and annotated gene counts |\r
| annotated_genes  | Unaligned fasta files of annotated genes identified across all samples |\r
| mafft                 | Mafft aligned fasta files of annotated genes identified across all samples |\r
| mafft_filtered        | Mafft aligned fasta files after the removal of sequences based on a missing data threshold |\r
