    ns1:description """**Name:** K-Means GPU Cache ON  \r
**Contact Person**: cristian.tatu@bsc.es  \r
**Access Level**: public  \r
**License Agreement**: Apache2  \r
**Platform**: COMPSs  \r
**Machine**: Minotauro-MN4  \r
\r
K-Means running on the GPU leveraging COMPSs GPU Cache for deserialization speedup.  \r
Launched using 32 GPUs (16 nodes). Parameters used: K=40 and 32 blocks of size (1_000_000, 1200).  \r
It creates a block for each GPU. Total dataset shape is (32_000_000, 1200).  \r
Version dislib-0.9\r
\r
Average task execution time: 16 seconds""" ;
