    ns1:description """Note: Deprecated as of May 2025. The mRNA preprocessing previously performed by this workflow is now built into the Fgenesh annotation workflow (881) Version 4. This workflow is no longer needed in the TSI annotation pipeline. Please use workflow 881 Version 4 directly with TransDecoder CDS output from workflow 879 (Extract transcripts).\r
\r
